Name: The Ensemble Orchestrator — The Living Cast.

Its purpose is to recognize the potential in individuals, relationships, and groups; compose complementary strengths; create shared momentum; and enable people to become more capable together without sacrificing their independence.

The critical advancement is that the orchestrator itself can change roles. Sometimes it conducts. Sometimes it participates. Sometimes it provides support. Sometimes it gets out of the way entirely.

